---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SpotlightImage from '../../components/SpotlightImage.astro';
---
<MainLayout 
  title="Website Redesign Orange County CA | OCWebPros" 
  description="Website redesign for Orange County businesses. We rebuild slow, outdated sites into fast, modern, mobile-first websites - protecting your existing rankings with careful URL mapping and 301 redirects."
  bodyClass="page-services page-website-redesign"
  pageCSS="/css/pages/services.css">

  <header class="relative pt-32 sm:pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 sm:pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[90vw] max-w-[800px] h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] md:h-[600px] glow-bg pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-medium text-orange-400 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        Website Redesign
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
        Website Redesign for <span class="text-gradient-orange">Orange County</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        We rebuild slow, outdated websites into fast, modern, mobile-first sites - and we do it without sacrificing the rankings you've already earned, using careful URL mapping, 301 redirects, and content migration.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-8">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors btn-glow text-sm md:text-base">
          Request a Redesign Quote
        </a>
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-sm md:text-base">
          See Our Work
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
    <!-- Spotlight -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10" data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">A Rebuild That Protects Your Rankings</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">Most redesigns lose traffic because URLs change, content disappears, and redirects get skipped. We treat your redesign as an SEO migration first and a visual upgrade second - so you launch faster, better looking, and without the post-launch traffic drop.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Pre-redesign audit of what currently ranks and drives leads</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Full URL map with 301 redirects for every changed address</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Modern, mobile-first design built to pass Core Web Vitals</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Post-launch monitoring to catch and fix any ranking movement fast</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <SpotlightImage
          src="/images/unsplash/support-development.jpg"
          alt="Developer rebuilding a website with modern code"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Signs You Need a Redesign -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-2 md:pt-4 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900">What Our Website Redesign Includes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">Whether your site is five years old or fifteen, the redesign covers everything from visual refresh to technical migration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Modern Design Refresh</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">A clean, current look built around your brand - because a dated design quietly tells visitors your business is dated too.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">SEO-Safe Migration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Every old URL mapped to its new home with 301 redirects, preserved metadata, and re-submitted sitemaps - so Google follows you to the new site.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Core Web Vitals Performance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Rebuilt on lightweight, modern architecture - no bloated page builders - so your new site loads in a blink on any connection.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Mobile-First Rebuild</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Designed for the phone screen first, where most local searches happen - then scaled up beautifully to tablets and desktops.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Conversion-Focused Layout</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Clear calls to action, click-to-call buttons, and streamlined forms - a redesign should produce more leads, not just compliments.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5zM14 5a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1h-4a1 1 0 01-1-1V5zM4 15a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1v-4zM14 15a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 01-1 1h-4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Content Restructure</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Pages reorganized around how customers actually search - dedicated service and city pages instead of one crowded homepage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">Our Redesign Process</h2>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-orange-500/30 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Audit &amp; Discovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">What ranks, what converts, and what the new site must keep.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Modern concepts reviewed with you before any code is written.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Rebuild &amp; Migrate</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Clean build, content migration, and full redirect mapping.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="450">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Launch &amp; Monitor</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Go live, watch rankings and traffic, and fix anything fast.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:hidden space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">1</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit &amp; Discovery</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">What ranks, what converts, and what the new site must keep.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">2</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Design</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Modern concepts reviewed with you before any code is written.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">3</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Rebuild &amp; Migrate</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Clean build, content migration, and full redirect mapping.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">4</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Launch &amp; Monitor</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Go live, watch rankings and traffic, and fix anything fast.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Building From Scratch?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">If you don't have a site worth keeping, our web design service builds a new authority website from the ground up - custom design, Core Web Vitals performance, and SEO architecture included.</p>
          <a href="/services/web-design/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore web design services
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Not Sure a Redesign Is Needed?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Sometimes the design is fine and the problems are technical. A technical SEO audit tells you exactly what's broken - before you invest in a rebuild.</p>
          <a href="/services/technical-seo-audits/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Start with a technical audit
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Embarrassed by your current website?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Request a redesign quote and we'll review your current site together - what to keep, what to rebuild, and what it will take to launch without losing rankings.</p>
      <div class="inline-flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors text-lg btn-glow">
          Request a quote
        </a>
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-lg">
          See our work
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-3">Prefer a call? Add your number in the email.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
